   "id": "fn-p012-1",
   "page": 12,
   "mark": "4",
   "text": "Theworld’sfastest“supercomputer”isthecollectionofallthebitcoinminers,whichhavea total FLOP rate of 5 million petaFLOPs, about a thousand times more than all the single site supercomputers combined.",
   "marks": [
